Just finished the game. Got it on humble bundle sale, I liked it, I recomend it. Never played the older thief games.
Pros:
- Graphics;
- Overall atmosphere;
- Good stealth system;
- Open levels, some more than others (the game is not an open-world);
- Replayability (Every quest is replayable and after you've completed the main story you can run around the city freely to complete whats left);
- Mantle api (I have an AMD graphics card);
- Customizable difficulty (which plays well with replayability);
Cons:
- There was a boss fight where I had a couple of crashes;
- Not often but sometimes the AI has weird behaviour;
- The parkour can sometimes be annoying because it doesnt function as espected, especially the jumping;
- The story overall was okish, it got the game moving forward, but the ending was weak.
Tip: Save game often.
TLDR: An unpolished gem, still if you can look past its flaws it is entertaining.

